  "body": "## XPRS 1.12.1\n\nA build release: no changes inside the app since 1.12.0.\n\n### F-Droid\n- The app's source dependencies (reticulum-dart, core, zx, the wapp sources and the xcc compiler) are now pinned as git submodules under `deps/`, as F-Droid's maintainers asked in #2.\n- F-Droid's build recipe no longer names any dependency, so F-Droid can pick up new XPRS versions on its own instead of waiting for a hand-made update.\n- The Android APKs are still reproducible: each one matches F-Droid's own build of the same commit.",
